10. Conformance

An implementation conforms to APS if it:

Implements canonical policy concepts.
Supports policy governance.
Supports policy evaluation.
Preserves policy traceability.
Supports policy versioning.
Maintains policy explainability.
11. Future Evolution

Future revisions MAY introduce:

AI-native policy reasoning.
Self-adaptive policy systems.
Cross-enterprise policy federation.
Machine-verifiable regulations.
Autonomous governance policies.
Domain-specific policy libraries.

Extensions SHALL preserve canonical policy semantics.

